@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #41546B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam classBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF3F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
hide footbox
title 创建分级管理员 · structured（候选范围校验与原子写入）
autonumber
participant "obj: AccountController" as C
participant "service: StructuredAuthService" as S
participant "dao: AuthDao" as D
participant "roles: AdminRoleDao" as R
participant "«MetaClass»\n: StructuredAdminHierarchyProcedures" as P
participant "rbac: RbacUseCase" as Audit
activate C
C -> S: createAccount(input, actor)
activate S
note over S,Audit: createAccount 事务：下面任一写入失败均回滚；账号行锁持有至事务结束
S -> D: lockAccounts()
activate D
deactivate D
note over S,R: requireRole 校验角色存在（含 DAO 查询）
S -> D: nodes = nodes()
activate D
deactivate D
S -> R: roleFunctions = functionsByRole()
activate R
deactivate R
note over S,P
requestedParent / findNode / manages 校验目标上级；
解析部门与软件 ID，requireSoftwareRoleScope 检查角色范围。
本图聚焦这些前置条件成功后的候选树一致性分支。
end note
S -> P: candidateNodes = replaceNode(nodes, candidate)
activate P
deactivate P
S -> P: problems = findViolations(candidateNodes, roleFunctions)
activate P
deactivate P
alt problems 非空
 autonumber stop
 S --> C: ApiException (409 CONFLICT)，不保存账号
else problems 为空
 note right of S: encode(input.password())：校验长度并生成 BCrypt 摘要
 autonumber resume
 S -> D: id = createAccount(...)
 activate D
 deactivate D
 S -> D: replaceAccountApplications(id, applications)
 activate D
 deactivate D
 S -> D: replaceAccountDepartments(id, departments)
 activate D
 deactivate D
 S -> Audit: audit(..., ACCOUNT_CREATED, ...)
 activate Audit
 deactivate Audit
 autonumber stop
 S --> C: id
end
||12||
deactivate S
deactivate C
legend bottom
with / requireConsistent 两个私有静态包装的内容已展开；findViolations 返回问题列表，不抛领域异常。
Controller 返回 200 {id, username}；统一错误处理返回 409，前置权限/参数错误为 403/400。
endlegend
@enduml
